Spectacled beta: Journals, Notes and Tasks for Android, iOS, Web and Desktop, synced over CalDAV with your own server. No account needed.
New in this beta:
• iOS: alarms now arrive as notifications
• Faster, more reliable sync (large attachments, desktop)
• Clear messages when folders were deleted on the server
• Right-to-left languages shown correctly
• Nicer About screen with release notes and Mastodon link
Please send us your feedback!
